## Diagnostic services

We diagnose across the systems, not just the one with the light on:

- Transmission diagnostics
- ABS brake system diagnostics
- Electrical system troubleshooting
- Diesel particulate filter (DPF) diagnostics
- Suspension diagnostics
- Emission system diagnostics
- Dashboard warning lights

## Why bring it here

A diagnostic is worth what its conclusion is worth. Reading a code and replacing
the part it names is how a truck comes back twice for the same fault. Our
technicians work from the measurement out — voltage under load, pressure at the
port, the circuit rather than the component — so the repair that follows is the
repair the truck needed, done once.

